    "Third, we convert the symbolic Gibbs-Appell function into a PyTorch-compatible function so we can evaluate it numerically."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 101,
   "metadata": {
    "colab": {
     "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
    },
    "executionInfo": {
     "elapsed": 4,
     "status": "ok",
