   "source": [
    "Lastly, we convert the symbolic generalized forces into a PyTorch-compatible function so we can evaluate them numerically with tensors."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 103,
   "metadata": {
    "colab": {
