   "source": [
    "Next, we define a function that uses a trained neural network to compute generalized forces by differentiating the learned Gibbs-Appell function with respect to accelerations."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 117,
   "metadata": {
    "executionInfo": {
     "elapsed": 0,
