  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "First, to avoid using integrator functions that depend on NumPy, we implemented custom ones here."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 137,
   "metadata": {
    "executionInfo": {
     "elapsed": 7,
     "status": "ok",
     "timestamp": 1775090680198,
     "user": {
      "displayName": "Serhii Bahdasariants",
